; heraldry (docs/ART.md 7): one owner mark in two forms, and the sigils. # field, % shade, * charge;
; the division (per pale, fess, bend, quarterly) is applied inside the `: flag` rectangle.
;
;   ui/stack_banner  the stack standard (the gonfalon): a slate pole and crossbar carrying a 5x8 field
;                    with the civilization's sigil and swallow tails. The only owner mark on a stack;
;                    units/stack.js draws it (quiet, active and spent looks, the finial pip, the count).
;   ui/banner        its pole-less sibling for cities: the same field and tails hung from a rod with
;                    finials; art.js draws it at the city tile's top-left, the sigil centred on it.
;
; The 6x8 stack pennant (ui/pennant) is retired: a stack flies the gonfalon only.

= ui/stack_banner 7x12 0,0
: flag 1,2,5,8
: finial 0,0
: note the stack standard: a slate pole and crossbar with a 5x8 gonfalon (the owner's field and division, the civ sigil centred on it, swallow tails in the shade); the finial pip at 0,0 shows moves and heroes; stack.js draws it in the shade (quiet) except for your own movable or selected stack
4......
4444440
